  "evidence_contract": {
    "web": {
      "primary_tool": "mcp__browser__browser_snapshot",
      "evidence_kind": "dom_snapshot",
      "level": "interaction-level"
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "The product under test is the POG portal at http://127.0.0.1:5183 \u2014 a real web app, NOT a kitsoki story. Do not call mcp__kitsoki__session_new for the primary_story; browse the portal directly with mcp__browser__browser_navigate.",
    "browser_snapshot returns a ref-based interactive-element snapshot (JSON), the evidence unit for this driver. Persist every snapshot you rely on as a file in the leg's evidence_dir (write the JSON yourself) before citing it.",
    "Use affordances (data-testid selectors) for deterministic clicks; browser_find locates elements from the latest snapshot; observe/act are Stagehand-grounded for anything the affordance map does not cover.",
    "The QA objective is to find and file real product feedback: improvement ideas and bugs. File findings through the portal's own embedded feedback widget so they enter the reviewed-feedback autonomous-fix loop, and include the run id in the report text so the finding is attributable to this QA run."
  ],
  "oracles": []
}